Horizontal Pull

Vertical Push

Vertical Pull

Carry

Rotation

Anti-Rotation

Locomotion

Jump

Sprint

Throw

Strike

Kick

Sprawl

Bridge

Ground Transition

Movement patterns form one of the primary organizational structures of the Knowledge Base.

